@startuml
title Talvori A-SRS – Per-Word State Machine (S0–S5, Mastered)

hide empty description

state "S0 (Reservoir)\n(stage=0, ever_enrolled=false)" as S0
state "S1" as S1
state "S2" as S2
state "S3" as S3
state "S4" as S4
state "S5" as S5
state "Mastered\n(is_mastered=true)" as M

' ---- Guards / Invariants (conceptual) ----
note right of S0
INV-1: ever_enrolled=true => stage>=1
INV-2: stage>=1 => ever_enrolled=true
INV-3: is_mastered=true => not in review queue
INV-4: is_mastered can become false ONLY via reactivate
end note

' ---- Enrollment is NOT an answer-event, only via Refill-Transaction ----
S0 --> S1 : enroll (refill)\n[capacity>0 AND S1_count<S1_max]\naction: stage=1, ever_enrolled=true, streak=0

' ---- Review answers happen only for S1..S5 (S0 not in queue) ----
S1 --> S2 : correct x2 in a row\n(threshold(1)=2)\naction: stage++, streak=0
S2 --> S3 : correct x2 in a row\n(threshold(2)=2)\naction: stage++, streak=0
S3 --> S4 : correct x2 in a row\n(threshold(3)=2)\naction: stage++, streak=0
S4 --> S5 : correct x3 in a row\n(threshold(4)=3)\naction: stage++, streak=0

S1 --> S1 : wrong\naction: streak=0
S2 --> S1 : wrong\naction: stage--, streak=0
S3 --> S2 : wrong\naction: stage--, streak=0
S4 --> S3 : wrong\naction: stage--, streak=0
S5 --> S4 : wrong\naction: stage--, streak=0

S5 --> M : correct x3 in a row\n(threshold(5)=3)\n[maturity_condition=true]\naction: is_mastered=true, mastered_at=now, streak=0
S5 --> S5 : correct x3 in a row\n(threshold(5)=3)\n[maturity_condition=false]\naction: streak=0 (stay S5)

' ---- Reactivation (explicit UI action only) ----
M --> S5 : reactivate (explicit UI)\naction: is_mastered=false, stage=5, streak=0, mastered_at=null

@enduml


